</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class="rt-col-md-3 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item rt-grid-item" data-id="68150"><div class="rt-holder"><div class="rt-img-holder"><a data-id="68150" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/shawnee-community-college-sees-double-digit-growth-in-online-and-dual-credit-enrollment/"><img width="640" height="480" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/scc-student.jpg" class="rt-img-responsive " alt="" /></a></div> <div class="rt-detail"><div class="post-meta-user "><span class="date-meta"><i class="tpg-flaticon-calendar "></i>October 28, 2026</span><span class="author"><i class="tpg-flaticon-user "></i><a href="https://shawneecc.edu/author/kevin-hunsperger/">Kevin Hunsperger</a></span></div><h3 class="entry-title"><a data-id="68150" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/shawnee-community-college-sees-double-digit-growth-in-online-and-dual-credit-enrollment/">Shawnee Community College Sees Double-Digit Growth in Online and Dual Credit Enrollment</a></h3><div class="tpg-excerpt">ULLIN, IL (October 28, 2026) – Shawnee Community College is experiencing significant growth in online education and dual credit enrollment, according to the Illinois Community College Board&#8217;s (ICCB) Fall 2026...</div><div class="post-meta "><span class="read-more"><a data-id="68150" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/shawnee-community-college-sees-double-digit-growth-in-online-and-dual-credit-enrollment/">Read More</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class="rt-col-md-3 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item rt-grid-item" data-id="67889"><div class="rt-holder"><div class="rt-img-holder"><a data-id="67889" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/actions-from-the-october-2026-shawnee-community-college-board-of-trustees-meeting/"><img width="558" height="383" src="/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/campus-resources-thumbnail.jpg" class="rt-img-responsive " alt="SCC Exterior" /></a></div> <div class="rt-detail"><div class="post-meta-user "><span class="date-meta"><i class="tpg-flaticon-calendar "></i>October 19, 2026</span><span class="author"><i class="tpg-flaticon-user "></i><a href="https://shawneecc.edu/author/shawnee/">Shawnee College</a></span></div><h3 class="entry-title"><a data-id="67889" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/actions-from-the-october-2026-shawnee-community-college-board-of-trustees-meeting/">Actions from the October 2026 Shawnee Community College Board of Trustees Meeting</a></h3><div class="tpg-excerpt">ULLIN, IL (October 19, 2026) &#8211;&nbsp;The Board of Trustees of Shawnee Community College held its regular meeting on October 15, 2026 at 6:00 PM on the main campus and via...</div><div class="post-meta "><span class="read-more"><a data-id="67889" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/actions-from-the-october-2026-shawnee-community-college-board-of-trustees-meeting/">Read More</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class="rt-col-md-3 rt-col-sm-6 rt-col-xs-12 even-grid-item rt-grid-item" data-id="67736"><div class="rt-holder"><div class="rt-img-holder"><a data-id="67736" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/nearly-400-high-school-students-experience-college-life-at-shawnee-community-college-day/"><img width="640" height="480" src="/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/SCC-Day-2026.jpg" class="rt-img-responsive " alt="" /></a></div> <div class="rt-detail"><div class="post-meta-user "><span class="date-meta"><i class="tpg-flaticon-calendar "></i>October 8, 2026</span><span class="author"><i class="tpg-flaticon-user "></i><a href="https://shawneecc.edu/author/kevin-hunsperger/">Kevin Hunsperger</a></span></div><h3 class="entry-title"><a data-id="67736" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/nearly-400-high-school-students-experience-college-life-at-shawnee-community-college-day/">Nearly 400 High School Students Experience College Life at Shawnee Community College Day</a></h3><div class="tpg-excerpt">ULLIN, IL (October 8, 2026) — Nearly 400 students from 12 area high schools visited Shawnee Community College today for the College&#8217;s annual SCC Day, a campus-wide event designed to...</div><div class="post-meta "><span class="read-more"><a data-id="67736" class="" href="https://shawneecc.edu/news/press-releases/nearly-400-high-school-students-experience-college-life-at-shawnee-community-college-day/">Read More</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div>				<!-- <div id="bdpp-post-carousel-wrap-2" class="bdpp-wrap bdpp-post-carousel-wrap owl-carousel bdpp-design-18 bdpp-has-arrows bdpp-clearfix" data-conf="{&quot;slide_show&quot;:4,&quot;loop&quot;:true,&quot;slide_margin&quot;:20,&quot;start_position&quot;:0,&quot;arrows&quot;:true,&quot;dots&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;autoplay_interval&quot;:90000,&quot;speed&quot;:500,&quot;autoplay_hover_pause&quot;:true,&quot;nav_text&quot;:[&quot;&amp;#x2039;&quot;,&quot;&amp;#x203a;&quot;],&quot;lazyload&quot;:false,&quot;url_hash_listener&quot;:false,&quot;stage_padding&quot;:0,&quot;center&quot;:false,&quot;slide_scroll&quot;:4,&quot;auto_height&quot;:false}"><div class="bdpp-post-slide bdpp-post-68351 bdpp-post-standard bdpp-has-thumb" >
